              <div class="kv"><span class="label">Experience milestones</span><div class="chips chips--sm">{s.milestones.map((m) => <span class="pill pill--blue">{m}</span>)}</div></div>
              <div class="phone-row phone-row--compact">
                {s.screens.map((sc) => (
                  <figure><PhoneFrame><PlaceholderImage ratio="9/19" radius="14px" label={sc} /></PhoneFrame></figure>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <h3 class="sub-h"><span class="no">2</span>Acquisition &amp; cross-sell paths</h3>
      <p class="sub-p">More precise cross-sell touch points, across two dimensions: goal and need.</p>

      <div class="dim">
        <span class="dim-label">By goal</span>
        <div class="duo">
          <div class="duo-card">
            <h4>Clear-goal users</h4>
            <p>A direct entry point straight to the product.</p>
            <figure class="phone-row phone-row--single"><PhoneFrame><PlaceholderImage ratio="9/19" radius="20px" label="Direct entry point" /></PhoneFrame></figure>
          </div>
          <div class="duo-card">
            <h4>Unclear-goal users</h4>
            <p>Loosely matched via Shopee perks and the mission center.</p>
            <div class="phone-row phone-row--compact">
              <figure><PhoneFrame><PlaceholderImage ratio="9/19" radius="14px" label="Shopee perks" /></PhoneFrame></figure>
              <figure><PhoneFrame><PlaceholderImage ratio="9/19" radius="14px" label="Mission center" /></PhoneFrame></figure>
              <figure><PhoneFrame><PlaceholderImage ratio="9/19" radius="14px" label="Match result" /></PhoneFrame></figure>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="dim">
        <span class="dim-label">By need</span>
        <div class="need">
          <h4>Investing-minded users</h4>
          <div class="path">
            <span class="pill">Shopee high-interest perk / external channel</span><span class="vs-arrow">&rarr;</span>
            <span class="pill">Savings</span><span class="vs-arrow">&rarr;</span>
            <span class="pill pill--solid">Investing &amp; stock trading</span>
          </div>
          <p>
            Our users are mostly non-professional investors without a
            full investing framework yet. We skip fund supermarkets
            and performance rankings, since chasing rankings
            encourages performance-chasing behavior unsuited to
            non-professionals. We return to investing fundamentals:
            present funds by asset class, and plot them on a
            long-term risk/return map so users can see the full
            picture and build realistic expectations. The information
            architecture stays simple and in the user's control
            without encouraging over-decision-making; the wealth side
            emphasizes the product matrix and trust, the trading side
            keeps the product line lean.
          </p>
          <div class="phone-row">
            <figure><PhoneFrame><PlaceholderImage ratio="9/19" radius="20px" label="Wealth home" /></PhoneFrame></figure>
            <figure><PhoneFrame><PlaceholderImage ratio="9/19" radius="20px" label="Asset class & risk-return map" /></PhoneFrame></figure>
            <figure><PhoneFrame><PlaceholderImage ratio="9/19" radius="20px" label="Stock trading" /></PhoneFrame></figure>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="need">
          <h4>Spending-minded users</h4>
          <div class="path">
            <span class="pill">Shopee voucher / external channel</span><span class="vs-arrow">&rarr;</span>
            <span class="pill">Savings</span><span class="vs-arrow">&rarr;</span>
            <span class="pill pill--solid">Payments &amp; credit card</span>
          </div>
          <p>Rewards that are simple to calculate (credit card cashback, transparent exchange rates); flows as short as compliance allows; one job per screen.</p>
          <div class="phone-row">
            <figure><PhoneFrame><PlaceholderImage ratio="9/19" radius="20px" label="Credit card cashback" /></PhoneFrame></figure>
            <figure><PhoneFrame><PlaceholderImage ratio="9/19" radius="20px" label="Transparent FX" /></PhoneFrame></figure>
            <figure><PhoneFrame><PlaceholderImage ratio="9/19" radius="20px" label="One job per screen" /></PhoneFrame></figure>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

